 - Allergens are the 14 EU allergens, stored lowercase and sorted.
+
+## API access and audit (schema 3)
+
+`apiKeys` holds `{ key, name, role }` records. Roles are `viewer`, `cook`,
+and `manager`. Schema 2 files migrate with empty `apiKeys` and `audit` arrays,
+preserving any existing values. Configure keys explicitly after migration.
+
+`audit` is append-only request history: `{ time, name, method, path, status }`.
+API changes and their audit entry are persisted in the same save. Key secrets
+are never included in audit entries. Audit reads return newest entries first.
